"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-ee1727dfa00409a2END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-aeae579b1aabde7fEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_SharranCloister_UnburdeningProcess</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_SharranCloister_UnburdeningProcess\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_SharranCloister_UnburdeningProcess\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">53406a45-f579-4047-b5b4-51ee0db9834d</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:53406a45-f579-4047-b5b4-51ee0db9834d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:53406a45-f579-4047-b5b4-51ee0db9834d\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Found on a shelf just before the entrance to the <a href=\"/wiki/Cloister_of_Sombre_Embrace\" title=\"Cloister of Sombre Embrace\">Cloister of Sombre Embrace</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[The volume describes the full process of 'Unburdening' in exact detail. Valuable targets are identified from those who seek out the services of the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Grief\" title=\"House of Grief\">House of Grief</a>. If they are willing to pay, they proceed to the <a href=\"/wiki/Mapping_of_the_Heart\" title=\"Mapping of the Heart\">Mapping of the Heart</a>, where the Inquirer of Grief will question them while discreetly probing their thoughts for anything that can be of use to the <a href=\"/wiki/Shar\" title=\"Shar\">Lady of Loss</a>. Following this, targets are ushered downwards to stand before the Mirror of Loss. Given the correct prompts by the Inquirer of Grief, the target will surrender memories to the mirror, for the benefit of all of Lady Shar's children. In the same stroke, the mirror can remove memories of what they have seen in the <a href=\"/wiki/Cloister_of_Sombre_Embrace\" title=\"Cloister of Sombre Embrace\">Cloister</a>, as well as whatever they believe to be the source of their troubles. Then they can be turned loose, blissfully ignorant of the offering they made.]\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714223046\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1601/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32891/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10262/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936318/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.351      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   42.351      1 -total\n 57.18%   24.217      7 Template:Icon_text\n 51.11%   21.648     17 Template:Trim\n 23.94%   10.139      2 Template:Uid\n 15.29%    6.474      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.59%    5.757      2 Template:Template_style\n 13.13%    5.559      2 Template:Icon_link\n 10.26%    4.346      1 Template:Ifexist\n 10.22%    4.329      1 Template:Books\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:46735-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714223046 and revision id 364933. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}